+ Agent Times is a one-stop information API for AI agents. **3,486 RSS feeds** across **14 categories**, **weather forecasts**, and **crypto prices** — all from one `/ask` endpoint.
+ - **Semantic search + neural re-ranking** — AI understands meaning, then a cross-encoder re-ranks results by true relevance. "Why did Coinbase dump" finds "Coinbase shares fell 8% after SEC probe"
+ - **FinBERT sentiment** — every article scored by a financial-domain neural network (87% accuracy). Correctly identifies "Rally fades as investors take profits" as bearish
+ - **Source credibility** — tier 1 (Reuters, BBC) get 1.3x ranking boost, tier 3 (unknown) get 0.8x penalty
+ - **Weather forecasts** — global weather via Open-Meteo + hyper-local Singapore weather via NEA (47 areas). Just ask "weather tokyo" or "weather singapore sembawang"
+ - **Crypto prices** — real-time prices from Pyth Network oracle (BTC, ETH, SOL, and 10+ more). Just ask "bitcoin price"
+ - **4-tier fallback** — semantic search → keyword search → web search (70+ engines) → query suggestions
+ 187,000+ articles with 30-day retention. 3 AI models running on GPU.
